{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026SGXtfsDhoa1793112437.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國耐用品需求顯著增長，並見五個月以來最大增幅。</p><p></p><p>美國9月耐用品訂單按月上升百分之1.8，增幅是4月以來最大。8月耐用品訂單由下跌百分之0.1，向上修訂至升百分之0.1。扣除運輸的核心耐用品訂單，按月增長百分之0.5，較場8月高0.2個百分點。</p><p></p><p>反映企業開支前景，扣除飛機的非國防資本貨訂單，升幅由8月的百分之1.6，9月收窄至百之0.5。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T16:00:48.124391+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T14:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T18:58:11.001380+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T15:58:22.299938+00:00","content_hash":"3c0baa51f8e4f4758988d5f1942bf73b49b360df59757a0c60a49f7a6c4e6848","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T16:00:48.124391+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}